WEBVTT

00:07.862 --> 00:09.172
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.206 --> 00:10.862
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.344
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.379 --> 00:14.482
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.517 --> 00:17.344
- ♪ Ohh...
- ♪ 哦...

00:17.379 --> 00:19.448
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.482 --> 00:21.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.482 --> 00:23.344
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.379 --> 00:25.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.241 --> 00:27.482
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.517 --> 00:29.344
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.379 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.448
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.482 --> 00:35.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.620
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.655 --> 00:39.551
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.586 --> 00:40.896
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.758
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.793 --> 00:45.482
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.793
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:47.827 --> 00:49.758
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.793 --> 00:53.655
[twangy upbeat music]
[鼻音欢快的音乐]

00:53.689 --> 01:01.586
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:01.620 --> 01:04.000
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:04.034 --> 01:05.344
[alarm rings]
[警报响起]

01:05.379 --> 01:07.551
- Huh? Huh? What? What? What?
What's going on?
- 啊？啊？什么？什么？什么？
这是怎么回事？

01:07.586 --> 01:10.103
Oh, man.
What time is it?
哦，伙计。
现在是几奌？

01:10.137 --> 01:12.793
I think I overslept.
我想我睡过了头。

01:12.827 --> 01:15.586
Gah! I was supposed to meet the
girls at the beach!
嘎！我本来应该会见
海滩上的女孩们！

01:15.620 --> 01:17.965
I hope they stick
around till I get there.
我希望他们坚持下去
直到我到达那里。

01:18.000 --> 01:20.931
All right, time to crush it.
好吧，是时候粉碎它了。

01:20.965 --> 01:23.931
[rock music]
[摇滚乐]

01:23.965 --> 01:26.034
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:26.068 --> 01:30.965
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:31.000 --> 01:34.413
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:34.448 --> 01:36.482
Yeah.
是的。

01:36.517 --> 01:40.482
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

01:40.517 --> 01:43.551
Ahh, breakfast in a can.
啊，罐头早餐。

01:43.586 --> 01:45.620
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:45.655 --> 01:47.275
[gulping]
[吞咽]

01:47.310 --> 01:49.379
Oosh!
噢！

01:49.413 --> 01:52.931
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:52.965 --> 01:54.655
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:54.689 --> 01:56.137
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

01:56.172 --> 01:57.551
Facciabrutt'.
法夏布鲁特'。

01:57.586 --> 01:59.620
I can't let the girls
see me like this.
我不能让女孩们
看到我这个样子。

01:59.655 --> 02:01.482
I gotta get cleaned up.
我得清理一下。

02:03.931 --> 02:06.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:06.482 --> 02:07.758
Ah, c'mon.
啊，来吧。

02:07.793 --> 02:10.241
What's the deal?
这是怎么回事？

02:10.275 --> 02:12.827
Oh!
哦！

02:12.862 --> 02:14.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:14.448 --> 02:18.931
Hoo-boy, how long was I
out?
Hoo-boy，我多久了
出来？

02:18.965 --> 02:20.965
Ew.
Long enough for all this crud
呃。
足够长的时间来处理所有这些垃圾

02:21.000 --> 02:22.482
to get stuck on my shell.
卡在我的壳上。

02:22.517 --> 02:23.551
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

02:23.586 --> 02:26.965
Ohh, nasty.
哦，真恶心。

02:27.000 --> 02:30.000
Ahh, let's get this show on the
road.
啊，让我们把这个节目放在
路。

02:30.034 --> 02:32.931
[scatting]
[分散]

02:32.965 --> 02:35.862
- Well, there goes the
neighborhood...
- 好吧，那就是
邻里...

02:35.896 --> 02:37.137
for the better.
为了更好。

02:37.172 --> 02:38.344
[party horn honks]
[派对号角鸣响]

02:38.379 --> 02:41.034
So long, you big pink loser.
再见，你这个粉红大失败者。

02:41.068 --> 02:43.379
[laughs]
[笑]

02:43.413 --> 02:44.482
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

02:44.517 --> 02:45.586
Huh?
啊？

02:45.620 --> 02:48.206
[yawning]
[打哈欠]

02:51.689 --> 02:53.137
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:55.034 --> 02:56.655
Ohh!
哦！

02:56.689 --> 02:59.517
Augh!
啊啊！

02:59.551 --> 03:01.724
- Ohh!
- 哦！

03:01.758 --> 03:03.103
- Pthew!
- 噗！

03:03.137 --> 03:04.758
[trills tongue]
[舌头颤音]

03:04.793 --> 03:06.241
Uuuup.
呜呜呜。

03:06.275 --> 03:09.034
Time for my pre-breakfast
snack.
是时候吃早餐了
小吃。

03:09.068 --> 03:12.827
Come on out, yummy treat.
出来吧，好吃的。

03:12.862 --> 03:16.724
Smashy! Smashy! Smashy!
Smashy!
粉碎！粉碎！粉碎！
粉碎！

03:16.758 --> 03:18.172
Whoa!
哇！

03:18.206 --> 03:21.793
Ugh! Hey, where are you
going, Rock?
啊!嘿，你在哪里
去吧，洛克？

03:21.827 --> 03:23.275
I don't wanna move.
我不想动。

03:23.310 --> 03:26.758
I already live next to my best
friend Squidward
我已经和我最好的人住在一起了
朋友章鱼哥

03:26.793 --> 03:30.448
and the little yellow guy.
还有那个小黄人。

03:30.482 --> 03:31.931
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

03:31.965 --> 03:33.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:33.482 --> 03:37.517
- Huh? Huh? Huh?
- 啊？啊？啊？

03:37.551 --> 03:40.310
What the? Oh, you
gotta be kidding me.
什么？哦，你
开玩笑吧。

03:40.344 --> 03:41.724
How'd I get back here?
我怎么回到这里？

03:41.758 --> 03:43.448
- Mm...doot.
- 嗯...doot。

03:43.482 --> 03:45.758
Hup.
呵呵。

03:48.793 --> 03:49.758
- Huh?
- 啊？

03:49.793 --> 03:51.206
Oh. What do you think
you're doing,
哦。你觉得怎么样
你正在做的，

03:51.241 --> 03:54.172
ya  oobatz' parasite? Sheesh.
是奥巴茨的寄生虫吗？谢什。

03:54.206 --> 03:56.758
- What the?
- 什么？

03:56.793 --> 03:57.931
Oww.
哇哦。

03:57.965 --> 03:59.137
- Hi, Rock.
- 嗨，摇滚。

03:59.172 --> 04:01.482
I'm trying to enjoy a snack.
我正在尝试享用小吃。

04:01.517 --> 04:04.344
- Hey. The name is Tony, not
Rock.
- 嘿。我的名字叫托尼，不是
摇滚。

04:04.379 --> 04:07.241
And I think it's time for you
to vamoose.
我想你是时候了
迷走。

04:07.275 --> 04:10.310
- Huh? What's a...van moose?
- 啊？什么是……驼鹿？

04:10.344 --> 04:13.000
[horn honking
and tires squealing]
[喇叭鸣响
和轮胎吱吱声]

04:13.034 --> 04:14.689
- Heh-heh, you're a few pickles
short
- 呵呵，你就是几个泡菜
短

04:14.724 --> 04:16.310
of a jar, ain't ya, kid?
一个罐子，不是吗，孩子？

04:16.344 --> 04:19.586
I'll make it simple: this is my
shell.
我会简单地说：这是我的
外壳。

04:19.620 --> 04:23.862
I live here. You don't.
So beat it!
我住在这里。你不知道。
所以打败它吧！

04:23.896 --> 04:24.862
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

04:24.896 --> 04:26.586
You can't fool me.
你骗不了我的。

04:26.620 --> 04:30.655
This is my rock,
and I'm not leaving.
这是我的岩石，
我不会离开。

04:30.689 --> 04:33.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:33.689 --> 04:35.896
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:35.931 --> 04:39.137
All right, ya   gabbadost',
stay up there if you want.
好吧，你好啊，
如果你愿意的话就呆在那里。

04:39.172 --> 04:42.862
I've got places to be.
我还有地方要去。

04:43.931 --> 04:46.103
- Where are we going?
- 我们要去哪里？

04:46.137 --> 04:48.103
- Mel's Man Salon.
- 梅尔的男士沙龙。

04:48.137 --> 04:49.379
- Ugh!
- 呃！

04:49.413 --> 04:50.551
- Argh!
- 啊啊！

04:50.586 --> 04:53.275
- Best place in town to get a
manly makeover.
- 城里最好的地方
男子气概的改造。

04:54.241 --> 04:56.517
- Oh, heh-heh-heh.
- 哦，嘿嘿嘿。

04:56.551 --> 04:58.206
[growls]
[咆哮]

04:58.241 --> 04:59.275
- [scoffs]
- [嘲笑]

04:59.310 --> 05:00.448
- Mmm...ooh.
- 嗯...哦。

05:00.482 --> 05:03.827
[all mumbling and growling]
[所有的咕哝声和咆哮声]

05:03.862 --> 05:05.793
- Hey, Tony.
- 嘿，托尼。

05:05.827 --> 05:08.379
Good to see you again, but
you're late.
很高兴再次见到你，但是
你迟到了。

05:08.413 --> 05:10.137
- Oh, sorry, Mel.
- 哦，对不起，梅尔。

05:10.172 --> 05:11.448
I overslept a little.
我睡过头了一点。

05:11.482 --> 05:13.965
- A little? Your appointment
was for 30 years ago.
- 一点点？您的预约
是30年前的事了。

05:14.000 --> 05:17.482
- 30 years? Oh, hey, I never
was a morning person.
- 30年？哦，嘿，我从来没有
是一个早起的人。

05:17.517 --> 05:19.206
- Ah, you're tellin' me.
- 啊，你在告诉我。

05:19.241 --> 05:20.379
Tony, come on over.
托尼，过来吧。

05:20.413 --> 05:22.413
I got a chair all ready for
youse.
我已经准备好椅子了
你。

05:22.448 --> 05:25.448
[light upbeat music]
[轻快欢快的音乐]

05:25.482 --> 05:28.137
- Ooh, heh-heh-heh-heh.
- Mmm.
- 噢，嘿嘿嘿。
- 嗯。

05:28.172 --> 05:29.620
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

05:29.655 --> 05:34.206
- Mel, you still give the
closest shave in Bikini Bottom.
- 梅尔，你还是给
比基尼泳裤最接近的剃须。

05:34.241 --> 05:36.172
Could you do one more
thing for me, though?
你能再做一件事吗
但对我来说呢？

05:36.206 --> 05:37.758
- Ah, sure,
anything for you, Tony.
- 啊，当然，
任何东西都可以给你，托尼。

05:37.793 --> 05:41.310
- Take a little off the top...
of my shell!
- 把上面的部分去掉一点...
我的壳！

05:41.344 --> 05:45.551
- Ehh. Ehhhh.
- 呃。呃呃。

05:45.586 --> 05:49.931
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:49.965 --> 05:51.793
Ooh!
哦！

05:51.827 --> 05:53.172
Uh...heh-heh.
呃……呵呵。

05:53.206 --> 05:54.448
That tickles.
那很痒。

05:54.482 --> 05:56.310
- Well, it was worth a try.
- 嗯，值得一试。

05:56.344 --> 06:00.344
C'mon, kid, time for our next
stop.
来吧，孩子，我们下一次的时间到了
停下来。

06:00.379 --> 06:01.413
[stately orchestral music]
[庄严的管弦乐]

06:01.448 --> 06:03.758
- Oh, no, I don't want a bath.
- 哦，不，我不想洗澡。

06:03.793 --> 06:06.931
I already had one this year.
Ew!
我今年已经有一个了。
呃！

06:06.965 --> 06:09.620
- Don't get your Bermuda shorts
in a bunch, buddy.
- 不要穿百慕大短裤
一群人，伙计。

06:09.655 --> 06:11.965
We're just here for a
shvitz.
我们只是为了一个
什维茨。

06:12.000 --> 06:13.275
- Ow!
- 噢！

06:13.310 --> 06:15.620
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

06:15.655 --> 06:19.172
I'll tell ya, kid, this is
doing wonders for my back.
我告诉你，孩子，这是
为我的背部创造奇迹。

06:19.206 --> 06:23.137
I must have slept on it wrong
for the last 15 years or so.
我一定是睡错了
过去 15 年左右。

06:23.172 --> 06:25.551
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

06:25.586 --> 06:28.310
- Oh, if it's too hot,
you can always leave.
- 哦，如果太热的话
你可以随时离开。

06:28.344 --> 06:29.586
- No way.
- 决不。

06:29.620 --> 06:33.344
I'm just a little thirsty.
我只是有点渴。

06:33.379 --> 06:34.862
[bell dings]
[铃声]

06:34.896 --> 06:38.551
[slurping]
[发出声音]

06:38.586 --> 06:41.068
Mmm-ah.
嗯嗯。

06:41.103 --> 06:44.000
Mmm-ahh.
嗯嗯。

06:44.034 --> 06:47.413
[upbeat guitar music]
[欢快的吉他音乐]

06:47.448 --> 06:49.482
- Here we are, kid.
Last stop.
- 我们到了，孩子。
最后一站。

06:49.517 --> 06:52.689
Ho-ohh, there they are.
嗬哦，他们在那里。

06:52.724 --> 06:55.448
Hello, ladies.
你好，女士们。

06:55.482 --> 06:57.551
- Oh, so now he gets here.
- 哦，现在他来了。

06:57.586 --> 07:00.310
- We've been waiting 30 years
for you, Tony.
- 我们已经等了30年
为了你，托尼。

07:00.344 --> 07:02.793
You're lucky turtles
live so long.
你是幸运的乌龟
活这么久。

07:02.827 --> 07:06.103
- I know, I know, my
apologies, but never fear.
- 我知道，我知道，我的
道歉，但永远不要害怕。

07:06.137 --> 07:07.206
Tony's...huh?
托尼的……嗯？

07:07.241 --> 07:09.241
- Say, who's this?
- 说吧，这是谁？

07:09.275 --> 07:11.758
- Oh, you didn't say you
were bringing
-哦，你没说你
带来了

07:11.793 --> 07:13.551
your pet parasite.
你的宠物寄生虫。

07:13.586 --> 07:15.931
- Oh, now, this is a cute...
- 哦，现在，这是一个可爱的......

07:15.965 --> 07:17.448
- Uh, hello.
- 呃，你好。

07:17.482 --> 07:19.137
I didn't get all dolled up just
to be treated
我并没有把一切打扮得漂漂亮亮的
待治疗

07:19.172 --> 07:20.931
like snail litter.
像蜗牛垃圾一样。

07:20.965 --> 07:22.862
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:22.896 --> 07:24.965
That's it!
就是这样！

07:25.000 --> 07:26.344
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:26.379 --> 07:29.034
All right. I've had it up to
here with you.
好的。我已经受够了
和你在一起。

07:29.068 --> 07:30.310
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:30.344 --> 07:33.137
Eh-heh, heh-heh-heh-heh.
诶嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿。

07:33.172 --> 07:36.482
Excuse me a second,
ladies.
对不起，请稍等一下，
女士们。

07:37.275 --> 07:39.206
- Arrgh.
- Oh hey, Tony.
- 啊啊。
- 哦嘿，托尼。

07:39.241 --> 07:43.965
Check out all this cool stuff I
didn't know I had in this attic
看看我所有这些很酷的东西
不知道我在这个阁楼里

07:44.000 --> 07:45.931
I didn't know was here.
我不知道在这里。

07:45.965 --> 07:47.103
- Buttagots.
- 屁股。

07:47.137 --> 07:49.862
This ain't your attic,
and that ain't your stuff.
这不是你的阁楼，
那不是你的事。

07:49.896 --> 07:51.068
- Look.
- 看。

07:51.103 --> 07:54.206
The kitchen had everything I
need to make omelets.
厨房里有我想要的一切
需要做煎蛋卷。

07:54.241 --> 07:56.275
You want one?
你想要一个吗？

07:56.310 --> 07:59.758
Oops. Ah. Time for a new frying
pan.
哎呀。啊。是时候进行新的油炸了
潘。

07:59.793 --> 08:01.724
- That ain't a pan,
you  jamoke.
- 那不是平底锅，
你个加莫克。

08:01.758 --> 08:03.793
You're melting my record
collection.
你正在融化我的记录
收藏。

08:03.827 --> 08:05.551
- Oh.
- 哦。

08:05.586 --> 08:10.206
Oh, that would explain why the
stereo isn't working...
哦，这就能解释为什么
立体声无法工作...

08:10.241 --> 08:12.034
- My hi-fi.
- 我的高保真音响。

08:12.068 --> 08:14.931
Oof!
Pasta vasul.
钱币！
意大利面瓦苏尔。

08:14.965 --> 08:16.517
- Oh. This is so cool.
- 哦。这太酷了。

08:16.551 --> 08:20.379
Look, there's a bed hiding in
the wall.
看，里面藏着一张床
the wall.

08:20.413 --> 08:23.344
Ooh, I wonder if there's
anything else
哦哦，我想知道有没有
还有什么

08:23.379 --> 08:25.241
hiding in the wall.
躲在墙里。

08:25.275 --> 08:27.413
Maybe candy.
也许是糖果。

08:27.448 --> 08:29.379
- My wall art!
- 我的艺术墙！

08:29.413 --> 08:33.517
- No. Nothing here. Dang.
- 不，这里什么都没有。当当。

08:33.551 --> 08:35.241
Nope.
- Argh.
没有。
- 啊。

08:35.275 --> 08:37.344
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:37.379 --> 08:40.068
- Hyaah!!
Get out of my shell!
- 哈啊！！
滚出我的壳！

08:40.103 --> 08:42.310
- Get out of my rock!
- 滚出我的石头！

08:42.344 --> 08:43.620
- My shell.
- 我的壳。

08:43.655 --> 08:47.931
- My shell. Uh, duh, wait,
rock.
- 我的壳。呃，呃，等等，
摇滚。

08:47.965 --> 08:52.655
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:06.931 --> 09:09.965
- [chuckles]
This is exciting.
- [轻笑]
这很令人兴奋。

09:10.000 --> 09:12.689
- I've got a fiver
on the parasite.
- 我有五块钱
在寄生虫上。

09:16.172 --> 09:17.965
- Hey. That's my butt.
- 嘿。那是我的屁股。

09:18.000 --> 09:18.793
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

09:18.827 --> 09:22.068
Well, now your butt is my face.
好吧，现在你的屁股就是我的脸。

09:22.103 --> 09:23.586
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:23.620 --> 09:26.586
I'm taking my home home.
我要带我的家回家了

09:26.620 --> 09:27.793
- Oh, no, you're not.
- 哦，不，你不是。

09:27.827 --> 09:29.344
- Ehh!
- 呃！

09:29.379 --> 09:31.206
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:31.241 --> 09:33.103
- Ehh!
- 呃！

09:33.137 --> 09:34.827
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:37.034 --> 09:39.586
- H-h-h-h-help!
- 呼-呼-呼-救命！

09:39.620 --> 09:43.275
Help! Help! Help!
帮助！帮助！帮助！

09:43.310 --> 09:46.137
Help! Help!
帮助！帮助！

09:46.172 --> 09:47.448
Oh.
哦。

09:47.482 --> 09:51.586
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:57.172 --> 09:58.586
[traffic light dings]
[交通灯的声音]

09:58.620 --> 09:59.862
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:59.896 --> 10:02.034
- Hey. Hmm.
- 嘿。唔。

10:06.896 --> 10:09.620
[laughter]
[笑声]

10:09.655 --> 10:12.655
- Ha-ha-ha,
ha-ha-ha.
- 哈哈哈，
哈哈哈。

10:12.689 --> 10:15.034
- Hey. Get off of me, ya brats.
- 嘿。滚开我吧，你们这些小鬼。

10:15.068 --> 10:17.379
- Aww, gee whiz.
- Just having a good time.
- 哇哦，天哪。
- 只是玩得开心。

10:17.413 --> 10:19.413
- Aww, you guys...
- 哇哦，你们...

10:19.448 --> 10:20.689
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:20.724 --> 10:24.758
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa.
- 哇，哇，哇，哇，
哇，哇，哇。

10:24.793 --> 10:28.000
- Hey. You forgot your
to-go order.
- 嘿。你忘记了你的
外带订单。

10:28.034 --> 10:30.241
- Thank you.
- 谢谢。

10:32.448 --> 10:34.827
Ohh.
My shell!
哦。
我的壳！

10:34.862 --> 10:36.310
- My rock.
- 我的石头。

10:36.344 --> 10:38.758
both: Our home!
两人：我们的家！

10:38.793 --> 10:41.068
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:41.103 --> 10:43.793
- Yeesh. Couple of
babies over here.
- 是的。几个
宝贝们在这里。

10:43.827 --> 10:46.206
- Who needs this weepy mess?
- 谁需要这种令人哭泣的混乱？

10:46.241 --> 10:48.103
- Yeah. We came to
see action.
- 是的。我们来到
见行动。

10:48.137 --> 10:50.275
Let's vamoose.
让我们来吧。

10:50.310 --> 10:51.517
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

10:51.551 --> 10:54.172
[both sobbing]
[两人都抽泣]

10:54.206 --> 10:58.482
- Oh, Tony, I'm so sorry.
- 哦，托尼，我很抱歉。

10:58.517 --> 11:01.724
- I'm sorry too, kid.
- 我也很抱歉，孩子。

11:01.758 --> 11:07.103
- If we hadn't been fighting,
we'd both still have a home.
- 如果我们没有吵架的话
我们都有一个家。

11:07.137 --> 11:10.206
[both sobbing]
[两人都抽泣]

11:10.241 --> 11:12.551
Hey. Wait a minute.
嘿。等一下。

11:12.586 --> 11:15.310
I know another rock we could
share.
我知道另一块石头我们可以
分享。

11:15.344 --> 11:20.551
- Really? Hey, maybe you ain't
so brainless after all.
- 真的吗？嘿，也许你不是
毕竟这么没脑子。

11:20.586 --> 11:22.896
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

11:22.931 --> 11:26.482
Ahh.
啊。

11:26.517 --> 11:28.206
- Ahhh.
- 啊哈。

11:28.241 --> 11:32.655
[scatting]
[分散]

11:32.689 --> 11:36.000
Hey, ladies, check
out my new shell.
嘿，女士们，检查一下
拿出我的新外壳。

11:36.034 --> 11:40.310
both: Ooh, lookin' sharp, Tony.
两人：哦，看起来很敏锐，托尼。

11:40.344 --> 11:43.241
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

11:43.275 --> 11:45.000
My house!
我的房子！

11:45.034 --> 11:47.793
Come baaaaaaack.
来吧啊啊啊啊啊。

11:47.827 --> 11:51.896
[twangy upbeat music]
[鼻音欢快的音乐]

[鼻音欢快的音乐]